  "reflectionText": "Caleb stood before Joshua at eighty-five and asked for the hill country he had been promised forty-five years before. He said: I am still as strong today as I was in the day Moses sent me. What does it feel like to ask at the end of your years for the inheritance you were shown when you were young?"
